# protogenOS LXC server template. Mirrors profiles/server.packages minus what a
# container cannot use: no kernel, firmware, bootloader, disk health tools,
# NetworkManager (Proxmox configures systemd-networkd), or firewalld (use the
# Proxmox firewall instead).
base
openssh
man-db
# Editors people expect in a fresh container; vi is linked to vim at build.
nano
vim
bash-completion
curl
rsync
htop
# Everyday tools other container templates ship.
which
wget
unzip
lsof
bind
traceroute
sudo
tmux
fastfetch
# Container runtime; needs the Proxmox nesting and keyctl features.
docker
docker-compose
